    "img/campaign/染血的鸢尾花.webp": "img/campaign/bloody iris.webp",
    "——王玺是三年前那一夜之后开始缺角的。这件事宫里所有人都知道，也没有一个人写下来过。": "——Wang Xi started to lose her horns after that night three years ago. Everyone in the palace knew about this, and no one had ever written it down.",
    "……七个。": "...seven.",
    "……不是兵。板车、牲口、抱孩子的。往东走，走了很长一条。": "...not a soldier. Carts, animals, people carrying children. Go east, it's a long walk.",
    "……八个。还有一个人的章，一直没摘。": "...eight. There is another person whose seal has not been taken off.",
    "……剜痕不是新的。刀口的边翻起来，又被压平了，压痕里积了三年的灰。剜的时候，这册子还在王宫里。": "...the gouging marks are not new. The edge of the knife edge turned up and was flattened again. Three years of dust accumulated in the indentation. When it was cut out, the book was still in the palace.",
    "……劫驾者。": "...hijackers.",
    "……城破两个月了。他们怎么会在这儿？": "...The city has been in ruins for two months. Why are they here?",
